    {
      "name": "Article 9 Protection and prevention",
      "description": "4. As part of the ICT risk management framework, financial entities shall implement documented policies, procedures and controls for ICT change management. These changes include software, hardware, firmware, systems or security parameters, and must be based on a risk assessment approach as part of the overall change management process.",
