      "description": "1. Digital operational resilience testing programs shall include vulnerability assessments, scans, open source analyses, network security assessments, gap analyses, source code reviews, scenario-based tests, compatibility testing, performance testing, and penetration testing. Testing is required before deployment of applications and infrastructure supporting critical functions.",
